  "sentences": [
    {"text": "The still, unruffled lake lay cradled among the mountains, without a single ripple to trouble it.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The limpid, sapphire water mirrored the sky so faithfully that it was hard to say where one ended and the other began.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Small waves lapped softly at the shore, turning the pebbles over like a hand counting coins.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A heron stood in the quiet, reed-fringed shallows, as still as a held breath.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A thin, silvery mist drifted across the water as the sun came up.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Two swans glided across the lake towards the small, wooded islet.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The lake shimmered in the moonlight, and a flawless, mirror-like reflection of the peaks lay upon it.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The tumultuous, foaming cataract plunged over the precipice and vanished in a cloud of its own making.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The river leapt from the sheer, rocky cliff and thundered into the pool below.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Water cascaded down the rocks in a hundred bright threads.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Fine, cool spray hung in the air, and a faint, shimmering rainbow arched across the falls.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The spray drenched them to the skin long before they reached the foot of the falls.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "In the narrow, rocky gorge, the roar of the falls reverberated from wall to wall until thought itself was drowned.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Beneath the falls, the water churned and seethed before sliding, exhausted, into a deep, green pool.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A fish rose, and tiny, widening ripples spread across the surface like a thought.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A thrown stone shattered the reflection into a thousand trembling pieces.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Clamorous, honking geese skidded across the water and settled, grumbling, near the bank.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "One after another, the children dived from the rocks with whoops that echoed off the far shore.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "In winter the dark, desolate tarn froze from shore to shore, and not even a bird came near it.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "A battered, wooden rowing boat bobbed beside the jetty.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "In summer the stream merely trickled over the ledge, a thin, silver thread of water against the dark rock.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Thick, grey fog engulfed the far shore, and the boat seemed to hang in empty space.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The lake stretched for miles, and nowhere on it was there a sail, a jetty or a light.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Nobody knew what moved in the cold, fathomless depths beneath the keel.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "He picked his way over the slick, mossy rocks behind the curtain of the falls.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Pale, floating water lilies covered the mere, their petals open to the sun.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "After the rains, a wild, white torrent poured over the edge, hurling whole trees into the gorge.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The water was black and bottomless, and something stirred just beneath its skin.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Ducks squabbled over the crusts, and dragonflies stitched the air between the reeds.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "A single boat drifted on the empty lake, its oars trailing, its owner nowhere to be seen.", "vibe": "Lonely"}
  ]
